      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "HowlingGale",
        "name": "Howling Gale",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "By creating a localized change in pressure and temperature, Janna is able to create a small storm that grows in size with time. She can activate the spell again to release the storm. On release this storm will fly towards the direction it was cast in, dealing damage and knocking away any enemies in its path.",
        "bodyHtml": "Janna summons a tornado that grows stronger over 3 seconds then blows along its path. It deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(55/90/125/160/195 + (50% Ability Power)) - (85/135/185/235/285 + (80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Up</span> for 0.5 - 1.25 seconds. The distance, damage, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knock Up</span> duration increase based on how much the tornado grew. Janna can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> to send the tornado early.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(10/15/20/25/30 + (10% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Up</span> for an additional 0.25 seconds, and travels 20% farther for each second it grew, and always reaches its destination in 1.25 seconds.</span>",
        "iconFile": "HowlingGale.png",
