        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Janna surrounds herself in a magical storm, throwing enemies back. After the storm has settled, soothing winds heal nearby allies while the ability is active.",
        "bodyHtml": "Janna summons a magical monsoon, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Back</span> nearby enemies then healing nearby allies for <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(300/450/600 + (150% Ability Power)) Health</span> over 3 seconds. Moving or using an Ability ends the monsoon early.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knock Back</span> cannot push enemies over walls.</span>",
